---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="index">
<section class="home-hero home-hero--redesign" data-engine-hero>
  <div class="home-hero__photo" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="/assets/images/photos/engineering-workbench-generated.jpg" alt="" width="1736" height="906" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
  </div>
  <div class="container home-hero__inner">
    <div class="home-hero__copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Oberlin 3-2 Engineering Society</span>
      <h1>Engineering projects and 3-2 planning at Oberlin.</h1>
      <p class="home-hero__lead">The society is organizing for 2026–27. Members will choose the first projects, plan the first events, and share current 3-2 source links.</p>
      <div class="home-hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--gold" href="join">Submit membership interest <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        <a class="button button--glass" href="projects">Review project selection</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="home-signal__proof" aria-label="Membership details">
        <li>Open to every major</li>
        <li>3-2 enrollment is not required</li>
        <li>Founding in 2026–27</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<nav class="mission-rail" aria-label="Explore the society">
  <div class="container mission-rail__grid">
    <a href="projects"><span>Projects</span><strong>See how proposals will be reviewed.</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a>
    <a href="pathway"><span>3-2 Pathway</span><strong>Review planning steps and partner links.</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a>
    <a href="events"><span>Events</span><strong>No events have been announced yet.</strong><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="section aim-section" id="operating-plan">
  <div class="container aim-grid">
    <div class="aim-section__intro">
      <span class="eyebrow">Purpose</span>
      <h2>Meet other Oberlin students interested in engineering.</h2>
      <p>Students with engineering interests study in different majors and class years. The society is being organized so they can find collaborators and compare 3-2 questions.</p>
      <p>The founding group will decide which projects and events are realistic after it reviews student interest and available resources.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="aim-section__work">
      <h3>First-year tasks</h3>
      <ol class="aim-list">
        <li><span>01</span><p>Recruit members from different departments and class years.</p></li>
        <li><span>02</span><p>Review proposals and select projects that fit the available time, tools, workspace, budget, and safety requirements.</p></li>
        <li><span>03</span><p>Collect 3-2 questions and maintain links to Oberlin and partner-school pages.</p></li>
        <li><span>04</span><p>Announce the first event after its organizer, date, room, and access details are confirmed.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--maroon pathway-feature">
  <div class="container pathway-feature__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The academic pathway</span>
      <h2>Questions to review before applying.</h2>
      <p>The guide covers prerequisites, admission, financial aid, housing, and program length. Confirm your plan with an Oberlin adviser and the partner school.</p>
      <div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--secondary button--light" href="pathway">Read the student guide</a></div>
    </div>
    <figure class="pathway-map" aria-labelledby="pathway-map-caption">
      <div class="pathway-map__formula" aria-hidden="true"><span>3</span><i>→</i><span>2</span></div>
      <div class="pathway-map__track">
        <div class="pathway-map__year pathway-map__year--oberlin"><b>01</b><small>Oberlin</small></div>
        <div class="pathway-map__year pathway-map__year--oberlin"><b>02</b><small>Oberlin</small></div>
        <div class="pathway-map__year pathway-map__year--oberlin"><b>03</b><small>Oberlin</small></div>
        <div class="pathway-map__transfer" aria-hidden="true"><span>Transfer</span></div>
        <div class="pathway-map__partners">
          <div class="pathway-map__partners-heading"><b>Years 04–05</b><span>Partner engineering school</span></div>
          <div class="partner-logo-grid" aria-label="Oberlin 3-2 partner schools">
            <a href="https://www.admissions.caltech.edu/apply/32-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/images/partners/caltech.png" alt="Caltech" width="450" height="110"></a>
            <a href="https://case.edu/engineering/academics/undergraduate/32-program" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/images/partners/case-western-reserve.jpeg" alt="Case Western Reserve University" width="275" height="30"></a>
            <a href="https://undergrad.admissions.columbia.edu/apply/combinedplan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/images/partners/columbia-engineering.png" alt="Columbia Engineering" width="706" height="86"></a>
            <a href="https://engineering.washu.edu/academics/dual-degree-program/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img src="assets/images/partners/washu.png" alt="WashU" width="3126" height="758"></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figcaption id="pathway-map-caption"><strong>The standard 3-2 model</strong><span>Three years at Oberlin, followed by two at an engineering school. Partner timelines can differ.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">Events</span><h2>Event calendar.</h2></div>
      <p>Published listings include their date, room, and registration status.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" data-home-events aria-live="polite"><div class="empty-state"><h3>Loading planned events…</h3><p>Fetching the latest event information.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section founder-section">
  <div class="container founder-section__grid">
    <figure class="founder-photo">
      <img src="assets/images/photos/homepage-macro-generated.jpg" alt="A close view of circuit-board headers, jumper wires, and loose electronic components" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024">
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">From the founder</span>
      <h2>A group for hands-on engineering work.</h2>
      <p>Kwaku started the society because he wanted more opportunities to work on hardware and software projects with other Oberlin students.</p>
      <p>The first projects have not been selected. Members will review ideas after checking the lead, workspace, tools, cost, and safety needs.</p>
      <p class="founder-credit"><strong>Frank (Kwaku) Kusi Appiah</strong><span>Founder and president</span></p>
      <div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="join">Tell us what interests you</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="leadership">See open roles</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
